---@class azure.servicefabricmanagedclusters.VmssDataDisk
---@field lun number Specifies the logical unit number of the data disk. This value is used to identify data disks within the VM and therefore must be unique for each data disk attached to a VM. Lun 0 is reserved for the service fabric data disk.
